#: ../../source/index.rst:29
msgid "Mission Planner Overview"
msgstr "Mission Planner 概述"

#: ../../source/index.rst:29
msgid "Loading Firmware onto boards with existing ArduPilot firmware"
msgstr "将固件加载到已有 ArduPilot 固件的飞控板"

#: ../../source/index.rst:29
msgid ""
"Loading Firmware onto boards without existing ArduPilot firmware (first time"
" only)"
msgstr "将固件加载到没有 ArduPilot 固件的飞控板（仅限首次）"

#: ../../source/index.rst:5 e438292ffa834135951d517728688e79
msgid "Mission Planner Home"
msgstr "Mission Planner 主页"

#: ../../source/index.rst:13 6309c122fd8a494f9decde119ed5998a
msgid ""
"The Mission Planner, created by Michael Oborne, does a lot more than its "
"name. Here are some of the features:"
msgstr "Mission Planner 由 Michael Oborne 开发，其功能远不止名称所示。以下是部分功能："

#: ../../source/index.rst:16 36da4dfd194649529405bd99ac036c00
msgid ""
"Point-and-click waypoint/fence/rally point entry, using Google "
"Maps/Bing/Open street maps/Custom WMS."
msgstr "通过点击方式输入航点/围栏/集结点，支持 Google Maps/Bing/Open Street Maps/自定义 WMS。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:18 6dca69748e594884b9ea9676879f6b2b
msgid "Select mission commands from drop-down menus"
msgstr "从下拉菜单中选择任务命令"

#: ../../source/index.rst:19 325f4fefda454cd18f2c14b880ee42d0
msgid "Download mission log files and analyze them"
msgstr "下载任务日志文件并进行分析"

#: ../../source/index.rst:20 d3cf83a4d34e42b5bfc2d67b015db45e
msgid "Configure autopilot settings for your vehicle"
msgstr "为您的飞行器配置飞控参数"

#: ../../source/index.rst:21 05cc64608cf6438cb56872cd9531c2f5
msgid ""
"Interface with a PC flight simulator to create a full software-in-the-loop "
"(SITL) UAV simulator."
msgstr "与 PC 飞行仿真器对接，构建完整的软件在环（SITL）UAV 仿真环境。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:23 d52c02c293f4419c89056bacc1dc28e8
msgid ""
"Run its own SITL simulation of many frames types for all the ArduPilot "
"vehicles."
msgstr "可对 ArduPilot 所有飞行器的多种机架类型运行其自带的 SITL 仿真。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:26 56d76bbe44f2486585743dcb0391e877
msgid "Please use the sidebar menus for instructions and more information."
msgstr "请使用侧边菜单查阅操作说明和更多信息。"

